<body>
<div type="letter">
<pb facs="1361512" n="1"/>
  <p> <abbr>Illustriss.<hi rend="sup">o</hi></abbr> et <abbr>Doctiss.<hi rend="sup">o</hi></abbr> Viro <rs key="pers_DE-588-119166895" type="person">Nicolao Bernoulli</rs>
      <lb/><rs key="pers_DE-588-102552517" type="person">Petrus <abbr>Ant.<hi rend="sup">us</hi></abbr> Michelottus</rs> <abbr>S. P. D.</abbr></p>
  <p><lb/>Summa cum voluptate ex tuis <rs key="B_991170517051405501" type="letter">literis</rs> audio te non adeo adversa
      <lb/>in pr<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>sentiarum frui valetudine. Si opus erit, pilulas omnes
      <lb/>octo simul, successive degluties, nempe quotiescunque repletione
      <lb/>stomachi laborabis<subst><del>,</del><add>.</add></subst> Pilularum vices geret optima di<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>ta
      <lb/>et moderatum exercitium. De illo <rs type="person">amico</rs> <abbr>etc.</abbr> verba faciemus
      <lb/>coram futuris bacanalibus. Gratum mihi fuit quod mihi commu<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>nicasti, scilicet<del> id quod de me</del> <rs type="person">amicum</rs> illum de me <choice><sic>qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>stum</sic><corr>qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>situm</corr></choice>.
      <lb/>Plures sane ille a me favores recepit quam ego ab illo. Pro iis qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>
      <lb/>de me bene scripsit retribui, retribuamque in posterum. Verum<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>tamen de his ali<choice><orig><g ref="#agrav">à</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice>s. Debeo enim gratias agere <abbr>Celeber.</abbr> <rs type="person" key="pers_DE-588-118509969">Patruo</rs> tuo
      <lb/>pro eruditissima et doctrinis plena <rs key="B_991170515152005501" type="letter">epistola</rs> quam <date when="1718-11-17">heri</date> ab
      <lb/>illo accepi circa solutionem problematis de invenienda
      <lb/>vi pressionis aëris in pulmone. Ipsum monui quod Te inter<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>cessore apud eum usus fuerim ut impetrarem lectionem
      <lb/>correctionem, et emendationem eorum qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> in mea <rs key="biblio_M3G2JA79" type="biblio"><abbr>Dissert.</abbr></rs>
      <lb/>continentur. Post mensem circiter spero me omnia habere
      <lb/>parata ut possim mittere (si tamen ipse volet) ad ipsum <abbr>Illustr.<hi rend="sup"><choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice></hi></abbr>
      <lb/><rs key="pers_DE-588-118509969" type="person">Patruum</rs>, cujus benevolentia et patientia abuti nollem.
      <lb/><choice><sic>Que</sic><corr>Qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice></corr></choice> de me cum <rs type="person">amicus</rs> <subst><del>t</del><add>(</add></subst>quem in posterum notabimus litera
      <lb/>incognita y<choice><orig><g ref="#ndot">.</g></orig><reg/></choice>) tum reliqui <rs type="person">Professores</rs> sentiant aut loquan<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>tur sive amice, sive inique, ut mihi significes rogo. <rs type="person">Monacus</rs>
      <lb/>quidam <rs key="place_GEO-3169070" type="place">Rom<choice><orig><g ref="#ahat">â</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice></rs> ad me misit quam h<choice><orig><g ref="#ihat">î</g></orig><reg>i</reg></choice>c adjicio <rs type="lostletter">epistolam</rs><note type="editorial">Die Beilage stammte von einem Bekannten Nicolaus I Bernoullis. Wie Nicolaus in seinem <rs type="letter" key="B_991170517050605501">Brief</rs> vom 24. November 1718 klarstellte, hatte dieser auch das an Michelotti gerichtete Begleitschreiben verfasst. O’Kelly wurde als Antwortadresse genannt (siehe Michelottis <rs type="letter" key="B_991170517050805501">Brief</rs> vom 23. November 1718).</note>,
      <lb/>simul rogando ut num bene valeas, et an ejus acceperis <rs type="letter">literas</rs>
      <lb/>illum certiorem faciam. Respondebo prout Tibi libebit.</p>
    <lb/><closer><salute>Vale Vir Amicissime.</salute>
    <dateline>Dabam <rs key="place_VER-repven" type="place">Venetiis</rs> <date when="1718-11-18"> <choice><abbr>a. d.</abbr><expan>a dato</expan></choice> 18 <abbr>N.<hi rend="sup">bris</hi></abbr> 1718</date> </dateline></closer><note hand="pers_DE-588-119166895"><foreign xml:lang="ger"><abbr>Empf.</abbr> den <date when="1718-12-19">19<hi rend="sup">ten</hi></date></foreign></note>
</div>
